Which of them a program built on these packages links depends on the
packages it imports -- the layering is described in the README and checked
by `make deps` -- so a program that imports only `table` links go-runewidth
and uax29 and nothing else listed here. The two commands, plot and diagram,
link all but go.yaml.in/yaml/v3.


